  notes: "Demo audit for BG-Library-Full-Module host project.\nUnity 6000.2.13f1 / Android target / IL2CPP backend (Unity 6 default).\nApplication ID: homecleaning.makeover.asmr.\nSDK matrix snapshot date: 2026-05-27 (refresh from latest *_buildreport.txt before production).\n\nReflection callsites surveyed (Assets/BG_Lib/):\n  - AdjustWrapper.cs - Activator.CreateInstance + GetMethod into AdjustSdk.* (production)\n  - Common/Scripts/Master.cs - generic FunctionExistAsPublic/PrivateInTarget helpers (runtime, name-passing API)\n  - 8 other matches are editor-only or vendored 3rd party (do not affect IL2CPP runtime).\n\nDecision: keep renameExports=OFF until blacklist covers AdjustSdk.* + every implicit-reflection SDK\n(Firebase, AdMob, AppLovin MAX, Unity Purchasing native bridges, IAP). Master.cs reflective helpers\nadditionally call game code methods by name - blacklisting requires per-game audit of callers."
